0..75 Comment "// The arms a match may write besides one constructor each: a wildcard that"
76..153 Comment "// takes every constructor the arms before it left, an or-pattern that shares"
154..231 Comment "// one body between constructors, and a pattern nested inside a constructor\'s"
232..283 Comment "// field (Augustsson, _Compiling pattern matching_,"
284..317 Comment "// doi:10.1007/3-540-15975-4_48)."
